---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white py-12 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded bg-sky-600 text-white font-black text-sm">
            AI
          </span>
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">AI Leaderboard Hub</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          一个开放、透明、可追溯的大模型能力评测榜单聚合项目。我们不伪造数据，不做跨榜混排，所有指标与排名均可溯源至原始来源与快照。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
          基于 Astro + Tailwind CSS 构建，完全静态部署，数据驱动。
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">
          快速导航
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li><a href={`${baseUrl}/`} class="hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400">首页总览</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${baseUrl}/compare`} class="hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400">多模型跨榜对照</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${baseUrl}/status`} class="hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400">数据与快照状态</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${baseUrl}/about`} class="hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400">收录准则与免责</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">
          开源与贡献
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/Alvin99/ai-leaderboard-hub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400">
              GitHub 仓库
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/Alvin99/ai-leaderboard-hub/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400">
              提交新榜单或数据纠错
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={`${baseUrl}/about#license`} class="hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400">
              MIT 开源许可声明
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <p>
        © {currentYear} AI Leaderboard Hub. 代码采用 MIT 协议开源。各榜单数据版权归原始机构所有。
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>不伪造数据</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>不做跨榜混排</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>完全静态开源</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
